<h2>Version 0.9.0 on 2026-09-20</h2>

<p>This is a small version that addresses a minor inconvenience with the
Emacs daemon process reporting an <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">unspecified-bg</code> under certain
circumstances. The workaround I defined ensures that we always use a
known colour value.</p>

<p>Other than that, the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">margin</code> face, which was introduced in Emacs
version 31, is also handled by <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">spacious-padding-mode</code>.</p>
        
      